WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.079 --> 00:00:04.060
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and hopefully
you’ve all had a chance to see Guardians

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.540
of the Galaxy.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.690
Definitely one of if not the most fun Marvel
movie so far.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:12.349
They already confirmed there’s a sequel
coming out July 2017 so this video is going

00:00:12.349 --> 00:00:21.420
to be the top 5 stories I think they should
do.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.189
If you’re just finding me for the first
time I do Marvel videos every week.

00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:26.180
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.900
And yes, I’m totally doing videos for all
the Marvel tv shows when they get here.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.359
Here’s something funny to think about.

00:00:31.359 --> 00:00:36.220
This past weekend Guardians made about 165
Million Dollars worldwide, so if you were

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.650
James Gunn you would probably celebrate by
taking a vacation right?

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:42.400
Well he actually spent the weekend starting
work on Guardians 2.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.582
He’s going to be writing and directing again.

00:00:43.582 --> 00:00:46.290
He didn’t just do that, he also ate a lot
of candy and talked with a lot of fans on

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.290
twitter.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.720
That sounds like something I would do.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.910
Just start working on my next video and tweet
funny gifs of dancing baby groots.

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.150
There were so many easter eggs during the
movie that I feel like half of my list is

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:58.190
a no-brainer.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.640
So Here’s my top 10 stories I think they
should do for Guardians 2.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.797
But careful for spoilers in case you haven’t
seen it yet.

00:01:02.797 --> 00:01:03.797
Because I’ll be talking about specific things
from the story.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.220
I’ll wait just a sec...okay?

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.220
Everybody Read?

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:07.590
Here we go.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:12.010
Number 5 - The Universal Church of Truth tries
to cleanse the Galaxy of impurity and bring

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:15.260
back the Magus, the evil future version of
Adam Warlock.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:21.520
He’s a big character himself, so he shows
up in various ways on this list, but just

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:28.890
like Ronan was the main villain in Guardians
and Thanos was on the periphery.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.881
Think of a Church of Truth story as being
all about their conquest.

00:01:30.881 --> 00:01:34.591
There’s only a couple of paths a sequel
can take, it can go bigger and up the stakes,

00:01:34.591 --> 00:01:38.900
it can go smaller and go deeper into a specific
character or it can be a time travel story,

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.430
which is also kind of an alternate universe
story depending on how the outcome is altered.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.140
I’ll talk more about time travel in the
marvel universe in a sec.

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:47.670
But doing a story with the Church would be
an escalation.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:57.320
In the comics Adam Warlock at a certain point
absorbed himself into the soul gem to prevent

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:00.771
a future where he turned into his evil self,
the Magus.

00:02:00.771 --> 00:02:01.771
The Church wants the Magus to come.

00:02:01.771 --> 00:02:03.820
So they could always go on a galactic crusade
to find the soul gem and unleash Adam Warlock’s

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:04.820
darker self.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:09.119
There are a couple of things that would make
this difficult.

00:02:09.119 --> 00:02:12.600
Mostly that Adam Warlock was an easter egg
in the post credits scene from Thor The Dark

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:13.600
World.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.270
That cocoon in the background, that’s Adam
Warlock’s cocoon.

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:21.660
In Guardians of the Galaxy’s post credits
scene, the collector’s cases are all shattered.

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.280
The cocoon from Dark World is broken.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:28.440
Meaning whatever was inside escaped.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:31.510
The tease being that Adam Warlock is out in
the Marvel Universe wandering around now free

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:34.780
to be used as a character the movies.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:43.270
Marvel actually put a company wide bad on
using the character in the comics after Annihilation

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:47.410
War but I don’t remember ever seeing a reason.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:49.540
Number 4 - Korvac Saga (Time Gem)

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:52.069
This is a time travel story, but they could
alter it a little.

00:02:52.069 --> 00:02:55.569
I don’t think any future Guardians sequel
will feature another Gem.

00:02:55.569 --> 00:02:59.960
I think we’ll see the Gauntlet in the next
Thor movie but we have no idea where the Time

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:00.960
Gem is.

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.819
Either it will show up in Avengers Age of
Ultron or some other characters movie in Phase

00:03:04.819 --> 00:03:07.290
3.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:16.810
Michael Korvac came back in time and assimilated
all of Galactus’ knowledge giving him these

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:17.810
godlike powers.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:23.212
He tries to remake the earth as a new utopia
but the Avengers and the Guardians of the

00:03:23.212 --> 00:03:24.600
Galaxy team up to stop him.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:29.870
It’s one of those predestination paradox
stories whereby at the end he sends his consciousness

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:33.400
to the future that he originally came from
setting off a chain of events that caused

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.370
him to travel back in time in the first place.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.870
So it’s like this never ending loop of causality.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:48.530
This seems a little too complicated for a
Marvel movie, so think of it as Korvac gaining

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:52.370
ultimate knowledge and the Guardians having
to team up with a few new characters and Benecio

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.250
Del Toro’s character to take them down.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:57.349
They kind of did this in the first movie,
but in the Korvac saga.

00:03:57.349 --> 00:04:01.269
Del Toro’s character, the Collector sends
his daughter to help the guardians.

00:04:01.269 --> 00:04:04.200
Number 3 - Marvel The End

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:08.550
This is a Thanos centric story and I hope
that if anything the sequel at least goes

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:09.810
deeper into his character.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.760
A group of celestial beings learn to harness
this power called the heart of the universe.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.689
It’s like a higgs boson situation whereby
everything that exists in the universe flows

00:04:17.689 --> 00:04:20.430
from this power source.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:25.210
Things go sideways and in order to stop them,
Thanos absorbs the power into himself becoming

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.539
one with the universe.

00:04:27.539 --> 00:04:30.830
He learns that everything is doomed to die
because of a fatal flaw in the structure of

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.849
reality and the only way to fix it is to reboot
the universe.

00:04:33.849 --> 00:04:37.460
He gets pissed but the aspect of death and
Adam Warlock convince him to do the right

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.460
thing.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:43.050
He reboots the universe but erases himself
from existence in the process.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:49.030
This story is different from the Infinity
Gauntlet storyline in that all the gems just

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.210
make thanos more powerful.

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:54.400
When he absorbs the heart of the universe
he himself becomes one with everything.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:59.249
All the cosmic beings of the universe like
Eternity, Infinity, Death, Galactus, they

00:04:59.249 --> 00:05:00.610
all just become part of him.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.469
Here’s how they could do this story in a
vastly simpler way.

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:10.180
The take the part about Thanos wanting to
fix the flaw in the structure of the universe

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.039
and make it part of his backstory.

00:05:12.039 --> 00:05:16.559
Like his quest for the gems just becomes part
of an ongoing quest for him to fix everything

00:05:16.559 --> 00:05:17.689
by destroying it and rebooting.

00:05:17.689 --> 00:05:20.330
I’m going to save the universe by blowing
it up.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.460
It sounds like a Doctor Who story.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:26.120
Which is why they probably won’t do it.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:30.300
Number 2 - The Cull Obsidian also known as
the Midnight Slaughter

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:34.099
This is a group of lieutenants that Thanos
assembles in the recent Infinity storyline

00:05:34.099 --> 00:05:35.169
from last year.

00:05:35.169 --> 00:05:44.020
It’s Corvus Glaive, Proxima Midnight, Supergiant,
Black Dwarf and Ebony Maw.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:47.960
Internally they call themselves the Black
Order and each member is called a Dreadlord.

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:54.059
In the movies so far we’ve only met The
Other who’s actually played by Alexis Denisoff,

00:05:54.059 --> 00:05:55.059
cool whedonverse fact.

00:05:55.059 --> 00:05:56.059
And now in guardians, Nebula.

00:05:56.059 --> 00:05:59.870
Although just like Gamora it seems like she
split on him too.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:02.610
It would be pretty cool to see Thanos assemble
his own evil Avengers.

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:06.120
I don’t know that a single movie could handle
that many characters, considering you already

00:06:06.120 --> 00:06:08.789
have the five Guardians characters returning.

00:06:08.789 --> 00:06:12.879
Thanos will eventually have to replace Gamora
and Nebula on his team though.

00:06:12.879 --> 00:06:20.399
Number 1 - Thanos Backstory in combination
with a few other big stories

00:06:20.399 --> 00:06:24.629
Usually what ends up happening is marvel movies
take pieces of different stories and use them

00:06:24.629 --> 00:06:25.629
together.

00:06:25.629 --> 00:06:28.589
So I’d really like to see a deep cut on
Thanos that spells out his past so that when

00:06:28.589 --> 00:06:32.369
we do get to Avengers 3, we don’t have to
spend half the movie explaining why he’s

00:06:32.369 --> 00:06:33.369
assembling the gems.

00:06:33.369 --> 00:06:39.080
So combine his backstory with war of kings,
minus the shi’ar, because Fox has rights

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:44.250
to them and add in Adam Warlock as like an
anti-thanos storyline that dovetails with

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.319
the next Avengers movie.

00:06:45.319 --> 00:06:49.639
So you see the rise of these two celestial
beings and the Guardians get caught between

00:06:49.639 --> 00:06:52.289
them in the middle of a giant galactic race
war.

00:06:52.289 --> 00:06:54.509
That actually sounds like Game of Thrones
in space.

00:06:54.509 --> 00:06:56.599
Which is a good reason why they will probably
do something way simpler.

00:06:56.599 --> 00:06:57.860
Movie plots tend to be pretty linear.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:00.699
So no Game of Thrones.

00:07:00.699 --> 00:07:03.789
And probably no infinity gem.

00:07:03.789 --> 00:07:09.449
It’s pretty obvious that they will do more
Thanos and Peter Quill’s Father.

00:07:09.449 --> 00:07:10.599
After that all bets are off.

00:07:10.599 --> 00:07:13.270
When Glenn Close said Quill came from something
ancient.

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:15.409
She was talking about an ancient race.

00:07:15.409 --> 00:07:18.729
His father is Jason of Spartax, emperor of
the Spartoi.

00:07:18.729 --> 00:07:21.259
They’re a cousin race to the Shi’ar.

00:07:21.259 --> 00:07:23.429
Since the Shi’ar are an X-Men universe race,
that means Fox owns their rights.

00:07:23.429 --> 00:07:27.479
Which might cause Marvel to alter Peter Quill’s
backstory a little in the movies.

00:07:27.479 --> 00:07:31.129
Until we get confirmation let’s assume it
will be the same as it is in the comics though.

00:07:31.129 --> 00:07:35.050
It’s likely that Quill will have to get
his father’s help to fight Thanos eventually.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:38.999
Like use the Spartoi fleet the way they got
the Nova Corps to help out.

00:07:38.999 --> 00:07:42.689
That whole scene where Glenn Close mentions
his genetics is a bit weird.

00:07:42.689 --> 00:07:47.139
I mean, the Spartoi aren’t a secret race,
if the Nova Corps knows what an infinity gem

00:07:47.139 --> 00:07:50.250
is, then why can’t their super machine identify
Spartoi DNA?

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.930
I don’t want to poke too many holes or anything,
but that did bug me a little.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:57.689
They might change it and make Peter Quill’s
father a celestial being like Thanos.

00:07:57.689 --> 00:08:01.629
Thanos isn’t a celestial, but he descends
from a celestial race.

00:08:01.629 --> 00:08:03.939
So for all intents and purposes he is a super
being.

00:08:03.939 --> 00:08:09.419
Interesting fact: In the comics, Peter Quill’s
grandfather is named Eson of Spartax as in

00:08:09.419 --> 00:08:12.179
Eson the Searcher.

00:08:12.179 --> 00:08:17.580
it’s a different character, but they could
use that fact to connect Peter Quill to the

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.300
celestials in the movie.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.089
But let me know what story from the comics
you want to see them use.

00:08:22.089 --> 00:08:23.759
Don’t forget that they’ll probably chop
up a bunch of stories and use different bits.

00:08:23.759 --> 00:08:28.929
And do you think that they’ll change Peter
Quill’s father and make him a celestial?

00:08:28.929 --> 00:08:31.699
My next Marvel video will probably be for
Avengers 2.

00:08:31.699 --> 00:08:32.959
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:08:32.959 --> 00:08:42.570
Now that Guardians is slowly going away we
can start focusing on Age of Ultron.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:45.950
Right now click here for my Guardians review
in case you haven’t seen it and click here

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:50.410
for a breakdown of the Avengers 2 trailer
at comic con.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:52.040
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:52.500
High Fives!

